#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-python_interface.md:11
#: 35ae63d3a7b74d25b61c1a7b7130c985
msgid "Install fa-py-libraries"
msgstr "安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-python_interface.md:13
#: aa4c37fa703a4253a140476e3ea69e04
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-python_interface.md:20
#: d6212fa5055a413f9f21a453689f8e4d
msgid ""
"`./init.sh all` initializes submodules, creates the env, and installs the"
" Python packages. Then use `./run.sh` (or `./run.sh viser`) for "
"launchers."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` 会初始化子模块、创建环境并安装 Python 包。然后用 `./run.sh`（或 `./run.sh "
"viser`）启动。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-python_interface.md:22
#: d857fd99a28e4320ac6106d7b5ba004c
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-python_interface.md:25
#: 5b823fa44d9d480e94daa7a044faf4de
msgid ""
"`pip install ros2-robot-interface` on system Python is not the documented"
" entry. If you must install the package alone, do it inside the fa-py-"
"libraries env after `./init.sh env 3.12`."
msgstr ""
"在系统 Python 上 `pip install ros2-robot-interface` 不是文档主入口。若必须单独装这个包，请在 "
"`./init.sh env 3.12` 之后的 fa-py-libraries 环境内安装。"

